9. **User: "warum heisst der magadalensberg magdalensberg linked. und nicht 70cm"** - The dropdown was showing `short_name` which was "Magdalensberg linked". Changed to show `site_name + band` instead, e.g. "Magdalensberg 70cm".

Key errors:
