   - **`client/src/components/BundMode.tsx`**
     - Most significant changes. Added state, loading, save function, socket listener, and dropdown UI
     - Final state of REP dropdown (after all iterations):
     ```tsx
     <label className="text-xs text-gray-500 hidden sm:inline">REP:</label>
     <select
       value={blHomeRepeaters[bl.code] || ''}
       onChange={e => {
         const val = e.target.value;
         setBlHomeRepeaters(prev => ({ ...prev, [bl.code]: val }));
